# Normalise text files to LF inside the repository, whatever the OS.
* text=auto

# The corpus is ground truth, and the conformance suite asserts byte-identity
# against it. Git's binary detection is a content heuristic (it looks for NUL
# bytes) — a small .workout file that happens not to contain one would be
# treated as text and have its line endings rewritten, corrupting it silently.
# Declare it explicitly so that can never happen.
*.workout binary
